id=nemu_boot_autostart
name=Nemu Boot Guard
version=1.9
versionCode=10
author=Nemu
description=Auto-unbrick guard (3 failed boots): verified clean shutdowns reset the counter; bounded suspend/component recovery with verification; only Nemu-owned disable-user packages and components are restored. v1.9 adds owned hidden-package, AppOps-mode and standby-bucket recovery for rescue/clear.
